    },
    {
      "seg_id": 21,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "There are several reports about the eradication rate of H.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 22,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "pylori in Korea, which show that less than 80% of the cases have achieved the desirable result.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 23,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "This low percentage has been attributed to antibiotic resistance.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 24,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "However, even without this resistance, there is still a lack of an effective drug therapy for the eradication of H.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 25,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "pylori.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 26,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Recently, in an effort to resolve this issue, the 10 day sequential therapy was introduced.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 27,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Most studies show that the effect of the sequential therapy is superior to that of the 7 day standard therapy.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 28,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "However, many of these studies conducted outside of the country.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 29,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "If the H.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 30,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "pylori infection rate in the country is still considerably high, then the need for this research to develop a new standard treatment is urgent.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 31,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "In this study, the goal is to verify the superiority of the 10 day sequential therapy as the new standard therapy for the treatment of H.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 32,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "pylori.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 33,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_중재상세설명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Patients are randomly allocated to receive a 10-day sequntial regimen (rabeprazole 20mg, amoxicillin 1.0g each administered twice daily for the first 5 days, followed by rabeprazole 20mg, clarithromycin 500mg, metronidazole 500mg, each administered twice daily for the remaining 5 days); or standard therapy(rabeprazole 20mg, amoxicillin 1.0g, clarithromycin 500mg, each administered twice daily for 7 days).",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 34,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_중재상세설명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "The eradication will be confirmed by urea breath test at 4 weeks after the last medication.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 35,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_군_1.중재군_군명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Standard group",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 36,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_군_1.중재군_상세내용",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "The patients in standard group receive a 7-day standard regimen (rabeprazole 20mg, amoxicillin 1.0g, clarithromycin 500mg, each administered twice daily for 7 days).",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 37,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_군_2.중재군_군명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Sequential group",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 38,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_군_2.중재군_상세내용",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "The patients in sequential group receive a 10-day sequntial regimen (rabeprazole 20mg, amoxicillin 1.0g each administered twice daily for the first 5 days, followed by rabeprazole 20mg, clarithromycin 500mg, metronidazole 500mg, each administered twice daily for the remaining 5 days).",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 39,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "9. 대상자선정기준_대상자 포함기준_내용",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "1) Ages between 18 and 85 2) Peptic ulcer(active or inactive) in endoscopy and positive for rapid urease test 3) No peptic ulcer in endoscopy but positive for rapid urease test, who want to eradicate the H.pylori 4) Participants who agree to participate in this study after informed consent",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 40,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "9. 대상자선정기준_대상자 제외기준",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "1) Patients who refused to participate in this study 2) Paticipants with a history of treatment for H.pylori 3) Use of proton pump inhibitor, antibiotics, H2-receptor antagonists, or bismuth in the previous 2 weeks 4) Concomitant use of anticoagulants, aspirin or steroids 5) History of gastric resection including endoscopic mucosal resection 6) Combined severe cardiovascular, pulmonary or endocrine disorders 7) Serious hepatic or renal dysfunction 8) hematologic disorders 9) Any kinds of malignant diseases 10) pregnancy or lactation, women who were not willing to practice acceptable contraception",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 41,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "10. 결과변수_주요결과변수_1.주요결과변수_평가항목",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
